65652a3710fa25a343ed9fb798.webm?t=1757065134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Heads are Better Than One!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the endless world of Everwind together with your friends! The game offers full support of co-op and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize your character!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust facial features, select from a variety of hairstyles and choose the skin tone that matches your liking!</p>","developers":["Enjoy Studio S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253100/81c5fb1f7602d9fe92ae9971e9c2b587e6cbeb54/header.jpg?t=1757065134","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 BOHEMIA INTERACTIVE a.s.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.2+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770 / AMD FX-9590 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 950 | AMD R9 290X or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 60FPS, Low settings, HDD Supported</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.2+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 | AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB ava